Description:

JMAP request validation follows RFC 8620 more closely.  A request with
duplicate JSON member names is notJSON.  /copy reports fromAccountNotFound
and fromAccountNotSupportedByMethod for an unusable fromAccountId.  A
missing or non-string sinceState is invalidArguments.  /set rejects
overlapping patch paths, and Email/set patches below a keyword or
mailboxId, with invalidPatch.


Documentation:

RFC 8620 sections 3.6, 5.2, 5.3 and 5.4.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that handle accountNotFound from a /copy should also handle
fromAccountNotFound.


GitHub issue:

None.
